            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "How US\u2013China tensions fuel rare earth 'supply-squeeze' fears",
            "description": "<p>Rare earth stocks, like MP Materials (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/MP\">MP</a>), USA Rare Earth (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/USAR\">USAR</a>), and Critical Metals (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/CRML\">CRML</a>), are in focus as China's rare earth dominance has become a major factor in US\u2013China trade talks.</p>\n<p>Yahoo Finance Senior Reporter <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/brooke-dipalma/\">Brooke DiPalma</a> and eToro global market analyst Lale Akoner join Opening Bid to discuss the recent price moves.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more <a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/opening-bid/\">Opening Bid</a>.</p>",
            "summary": "Rare earth stocks, like MP Materials (MP), USA Rare Earth (USAR), and Critical Metals (CRML), are in focus as China's rare earth dominance has become a major factor in US\u2013China trade talks. Yahoo Finance Senior Reporter Brooke DiPalma and eToro global market analyst Lale Akoner join Opening Bid to discuss the recent price moves. To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more Opening Bid.",
