            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "AMD & Oracle deal, Nova Minerals jumps, new Jeep Grand Wagoneer",
            "description": "<p>Here are some of the stories Wall Street is watching on Tuesday, Oct. 14. AMD (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/AMD\">AMD</a>) and Oracle (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/ORCL\">ORCL</a>) announced an <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/amd-and-oracle-announce-agreement-for-50000-gpus-as-ai-deal-spree-continues-121807781.html\">AI chip agreement</a>. Nova Minerals (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NVA\">NVA</a>) <a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/nova-minerals-stock-soars-after-announcing-white-house-interest-in-alaska-mining-project-135637807.html\">shares are jumping</a> after revealing the White House has expressed interest in its Alaska mining project. Stellantis's (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/STLA\">STLA</a>) Jeep unit unveiled its latest Jeep Grand Wagoneer.</p>\n<p>Stay up to date on the latest market action, minute-by-minute, with <a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-minute/\">Yahoo Finance's Market Minute.</a></p>",
            "summary": "Here are some of the stories Wall Street is watching on Tuesday, Oct. 14. AMD (AMD) and Oracle (ORCL) announced an AI chip agreement. Nova Minerals (NVA) shares are jumping after revealing the White House has expressed interest in its Alaska mining project. Stellantis's (STLA) Jeep unit unveiled its latest Jeep Grand Wagoneer. Stay up to date on the latest market action, minute-by-minute, with Yahoo Finance's Market Minute.",
